ch-summary-value tabular-nums">未声明</div></div><div><div class="research-summary-label">科学结论<span> · 记录中的判断</span></div><div class="research-summary-value tabular-nums">尚无定论</div></div></div><div class="research-panel space-y-3 p-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83Z"></path><path d="m22 17.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 17.65"></path><path d="m22 12.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 12.65"></path></svg>沿记录回看<span class="ml-auto text-[11px] font-normal text-muted-foreground">拖动查看当时的判断</span></div><label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground"><span class="shrink-0 tabular-nums">第 63 / 105 行</span><input type="range" min="1" max="105" class="w-full accent-primary" aria-label="回放到运行记录第几行" value="63"/></label></div><section class="research-panel research-focus" aria-label="当前焦点"><div class="mb-2 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">当前问题 · 当前焦点</div><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold">等待测量 P2</h3><div class="focus-lines"><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">P2：brief hyperpol 40ms 协议下真细胞 spike_count（reps=1）：ref/slow_na 校准 13.0、weakIh 校准 17.0、weakT 校准 20.0——三分 H3（无额外效应）/ H4（弱内向，慢 Ih flavour）/ H5（弱内向，快 T flavour）。</p><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">协议：brief hyperpol conditioning + test (-30 uA/40 ms, then +12 uA) · 重复 1 次</p><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">同协议候选仿真值 13–20（8 次；候选参数未记录，含参数差异）</p></div><p class="mt-1 flex items-start gap-1 text-[12px] text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" title="画布标记：宿主不强制"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 size-3 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><span>M-reps · 只测 1 次就要分清 3 种解释</span></p></section><section class="research-panel" aria-label="假设与证据"><div dir="ltr" data-orientation="horizontal"><div class="research-panel-heading"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-git-branch size-4 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="6" x2="6" y1="3" y2="15"></line><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"></circle><path d="M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9"></path></svg><h2>假设与证据</h2><span class="text-[11px] font-normal text-muted-foreground">5 个解释 · 2 个实验</span><div role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-muted p-1 text-muted-foreground ml-auto h-8" aria-label="假设呈现方式" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" style="outline:none"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="radix-:R19:-content-map" data-state="active" id="radix-:R19:-trigger-map" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md py-1 font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 data-[state=active]:bg-background data-[state=active]:text-foreground data-[state=active]:shadow px-3 text-[11px] transition-none" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" data-radix-collection-item="">假设图</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="radix-:R19:-content-matrix" data-state="inactive" id="radix-:R19:-trigger-matrix" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md py-1 font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 data-[state=active]:bg-background data-[state=active]:text-foreground data-[state=active]:shadow px-3 text-[11px] transition-none" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" data-radix-collection-item="">证据矩阵</button></div></div><p class="px-[18px] py-3 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">派生关系未记录</p><div data-state="active" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:R19:-trigger-map" id="radix-:R19:-content-map" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 research-evidence m-0" style="animation-duration:0s"><div class="research-hypothesis-grid" role="group" aria-label="假设派生图"><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H1</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">◐ 收窄</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">ca_rebound 的额外电流是净内向、超极化…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">ca_rebound 的额外电流是净内向、超极化恢复可用性的瞬态电流（T型钙样或 Ih 样）：超极化条件刺激解除失活/激活该电流，释放后在去极化测试期产生额外内向驱动，使测试期峰数显著高于裸细胞基线（15.3±噪声）。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H2</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">? 有争议</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">ca_rebound 的额外电流是活动依赖的外向…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">ca_rebound 的额外电流是活动依赖的外向 K 流（适应型）：去极化条件刺激激活它，压制后续测试反应；超极化条件刺激后测试反应不高于基线。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H3</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">○ 未定</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">额外电流对常规步进与超极化释放协议无显著影响（效…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">额外电流对常规步进与超极化释放协议无显著影响（效应集中在基线通道的慢 Na 失活动力学，slow_na=true），即放电表观变化全部可由基线通道解释，无需额外反弹电流。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H4</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">○ 未定</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">H1 的 SCOPED 变体：ca_reboun…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">H1 的 SCOPED 变体：ca_rebound 存在小电导（g≈0.05-0.15）的弱内向电流（Ih 样或弱 T 型样），超极化恢复其可用性，释放后提供适度内向驱动——足以解释 P1 观测 17.33 相对基线 15.33 的 +2.0 弱增强，但不足以达到 H1 的强反弹带 [18,30]。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H5</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">○ 未定</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">H4 的快瞬态 flavour：弱内向电流是 T…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">H4 的快瞬态 flavour：弱内向电流是 T 型钙样瞬态流（快 m 激活 + 快 h 失活恢复，h_tau≈40ms），40ms 超极化即充分恢复可用性，释放时产生瞬态爆发驱动——预测 brief hyperpol 40ms 协议显著增强（+4 以上），而慢 Ih 样 flavour 在该协议无效应。</span></button></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:R19:-trigger-matrix" hidden="" id="radix-:R19:-content-matrix" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 research-evidence m-0"></div></div><div class="border-t border-border/60 p-[18px]"><p class="mb-3 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">实验记录 · 按登记顺序 · 点击查看预测、测量与判读</p><div class="research-path"><button type="button" title="P1（3 次）"><span class="font-mono">P1</span><span class="max-w-40 truncate text-muted-foreground">（3 次）</span></button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><button type="button" title="P2（1 次）"><span class="font-mono">P2</span><span class="max-w-40 truncate text-muted-foreground">（1 次）</span></button></div></div></section><div class="research-bottom-grid"><section class="research-panel"><h3 class="research-panel-heading">阶段报告</h3><div class="research-panel-body"><div class="research-stage-section"><h4 class="text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground">已知</h4><ul><li>H1 SCOPED</li></ul></div><div class="research-stage-section"><h4 class="text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground">未知</h4><ul><li>H2 CONTESTED</li><li>H3 LIVE</li><li>H4 LIVE</li></ul></div><div class="research-stage-section"><h4 class="text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground">下一步</h4><ul><li>等待测量 P2</li></ul></div></div></section></div></div></div></div>"`;

