ing-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 research-evidence m-0" style="animation-duration:0s"><div class="research-hypothesis-grid" role="group" aria-label="假设派生图"><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H1</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">◐ 收窄</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">ca_rebound 的额外电流是净内向、超极化…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">ca_rebound 的额外电流是净内向、超极化恢复可用性的瞬态电流（T型钙样或 Ih 样）：超极化条件刺激解除失活/激活该电流，释放后在去极化测试期产生额外内向驱动，使测试期峰数显著高于裸细胞基线（15.3±噪声）。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H2</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">? 有争议</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">ca_rebound 的额外电流是活动依赖的外向…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">ca_rebound 的额外电流是活动依赖的外向 K 流（适应型）：去极化条件刺激激活它，压制后续测试反应；超极化条件刺激后测试反应不高于基线。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H3</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">○ 未定</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">额外电流对常规步进与超极化释放协议无显著影响（效…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">额外电流对常规步进与超极化释放协议无显著影响（效应集中在基线通道的慢 Na 失活动力学，slow_na=true），即放电表观变化全部可由基线通道解释，无需额外反弹电流。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H4</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">○ 未定</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">H1 的 SCOPED 变体：ca_reboun…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">H1 的 SCOPED 变体：ca_rebound 存在小电导（g≈0.05-0.15）的弱内向电流（Ih 样或弱 T 型样），超极化恢复其可用性，释放后提供适度内向驱动——足以解释 P1 观测 17.33 相对基线 15.33 的 +2.0 弱增强，但不足以达到 H1 的强反弹带 [18,30]。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H5</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">○ 未定</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">H4 的快瞬态 flavour：弱内向电流是 T…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">H4 的快瞬态 flavour：弱内向电流是 T 型钙样瞬态流（快 m 激活 + 快 h 失活恢复，h_tau≈40ms），40ms 超极化即充分恢复可用性，释放时产生瞬态爆发驱动——预测 brief hyperpol 40ms 协议显著增强（+4 以上），而慢 Ih 样 flavour 在该协议无效应。</span></button></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:R19:-trigger-matrix" hidden="" id="radix-:R19:-content-matrix" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 research-evidence m-0"></div></div><div class="border-t border-border/60 p-[18px]"><p class="mb-3 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">实验记录 · 按登记顺序 · 点击查看预测、测量与判读</p><div class="research-path"><button type="button" title="P1（3 次）"><span class="font-mono">P1</span><span class="max-w-40 truncate text-muted-foreground">（3 次）</span></button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><button type="button" title="P2（1 次）"><span class="font-mono">P2</span><span class="max-w-40 truncate text-muted-foreground">（1 次）</span></button></div></div></section><section class="research-panel p-5" aria-label="节点详情"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><h3 class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-[13px] font-semibold">P2 · brief hyperpol conditioning + test (-30 uA/40 ms, then +12 uA)</h3><button type="button" class="flex size-6 items-center justify-center rounded text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 hover:text-foreground" aria-label="收起详情（Esc）"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x size-3.5"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">问题</div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">brief hyperpol 40ms 协议下真细胞 spike_count（reps=1）：ref/slow_na 校准 13.0、weakIh 校准 17.0、weakT 校准 20.0——三分 H3（无额外效应）/ H4（弱内向，慢 Ih flavour）/ H5（弱内向，快 T flavour）。</p></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">登记</div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">协议：brief hyperpol conditioning + test (-30 uA/40 ms, then +12 uA)</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">重复 1 次</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">冻结：2026-10-14T13:04:14.282Z</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">spec sha256：79578c09448409ca65b99cf8fac5185f7f2cc6d113637fc0aeb1a5828da24748</p></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">预测区间</div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">H3 [10, 15.5]</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">H4 [15.6, 18.4]</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">H5 [18.5, 26]</p></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">预登记分支</div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">[10, 15.5] → 否定 H5</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">[10, 15.5] → 支持 H3</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">[15.6, 18.4] → 支持 H4</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">[15.6, 18.4] → 否定 H5</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">[18.5, 26] → 支持 H5</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">[18.5, 26] → 否定 H3</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">[18.5, 26] → 收窄 H4</p></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">登记前的仿真</div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">最近：同协议候选仿真值 13–20（8 次；候选参数未记录，含参数差异）</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">全程：同协议候选仿真值 13–22（16 次；候选参数未记录，含参数差异）</p></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">结果</div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">观测 13（1 次，花费 1）</p></div><div class="mt-2"><div class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">宿主复核</div><p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed tabular-nums">按观测重算，预登记分支应为：H3 → SUPPORTED、H5 → REFUTED</p></div><details class="mt-2"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">原始记录（4 行）</summary><pre class="mt-1 whitespace-pre-wrap break-all text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">63: {&quot;ts&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14T13:04:14.282Z&quot;,&quot;op&quot;:&quot;prereg.write&quot;,&quot;pid&quot;:&quot;P2&quot;,&quot;spec_sha256&quot;:&quot;79578c09448409ca65b99cf8fac5185f7f2cc6d113637fc0aeb1a5828da24748&quot;,&quot;prereg_path&quot;:&quot;prereg/P2.json&quot;,&quot;prev&quot;:&quot;2f1c5dc90149847e7e68fede197a14884305d14ac7080f60a5563bb89e981910&quot;}</pre><pre class="mt-1 whitespace-pre-wrap break-all text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">64: {&quot;ts&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14T13:04:18.400Z&quot;,&quot;op&quot;:&quot;probe.start&quot;,&quot;pid&quot;:&quot;P2&quot;,&quot;prev&quot;:&quot;52ef87e8b1d46c0068f053427d4702b050362ca9c8ce4c5e51874167b2c8fa77&quot;}</pre><pre class="mt-1 whitespace-pre-wrap break-all text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">65: {&quot;ts&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14T13:04:20.396Z&quot;,&quot;op&quot;:&quot;world.observe&quot;,&quot;world&quot;:&quot;ca_rebound&quot;,&quot;seed&quot;:20261014,&quot;protocol&quot;:&quot;brief hyperpol conditioning + test (-30 uA/40 ms, then +12 uA)&quot;,&quot;reps&quot;:1,&quot;blockers&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;cost&quot;:1,&quot;spike_count&quot;:13,&quot;pid&quot;:&quot;P2&quot;,&quot;prev&quot;:&quot;a803345f22e124b90a0d02a034afa2d31f2687a7dfaffb760848890065ea081e&quot;}</pre><pre class="mt-1 whitespace-pre-wrap break-all text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">66: {&quot;ts&quot;:&quot;2026-10-14T13:04:20.396Z&quot;,&quot;op&quot;:&quot;probe.land&quot;,&quot;pid&quot;:&quot;P2&quot;,&quot;exit_code&quot;:0,&quot;metric&quot;:13,&quot;prev&quot;:&quot;6e5f152b748641bd2d5f4f7947780f0bb514aea0785d56fc461046a344d71d15&quot;}</pre></details></section><section class="research-panel"><h3 class="research-panel-heading">一次反馈改变</h3><div class="research-panel-body"><ul class="space-y-0.5 text-[13px]"><li>P1 → P2</li><li>原协议：hyperpol conditioning + depol test (-30 uA/250 ms, then +12 uA)；实测 17.33（3 次），落在 H3 的预测区间</li><li>因此：H1 → ◐ 收窄、H2 → ? 有争议</li><li>新协议：brief hyperpol conditioning + test (-30 uA/40 ms, then +12 uA)；目的：brief hyperpol 40ms 协议下真细胞 spike_count（reps=1）：ref/slow_na 校准 13.0、weakIh 校准 17.0、weakT 校准 20.0——三分 H3（无额外效应）/ H4（弱内向，慢 Ih flavour）/ H5（弱内向，快 T flavour）。</li></ul></div></section><div class="research-bottom-grid"><section class="research-panel"><h3 class="research-panel-heading">阶段报告</h3><div class="research-panel-body"><div class="research-stage-section"><h4 class="text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground">已知</h4><ul><li>H1 SCOPED</li></ul></div><div class="research-stage-section"><h4 class="text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground">未知</h4><ul><li>H2 CONTESTED</li><li>H3 LIVE</li><li>H4 LIVE</li></ul></div><div class="research-stage-section"><h4 class="text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground">下一步</h4><ul><li>判读结果 P2</li></ul></div></div></section></div></div></div></div>"`;

