2="15"></line><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"></circle><path d="M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9"></path></svg><h2>假设与证据</h2><span class="text-[11px] font-normal text-muted-foreground">5 个解释 · 4 个实验</span><div role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-muted p-1 text-muted-foreground ml-auto h-8" aria-label="假设呈现方式" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" style="outline:none"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="radix-:R19:-content-map" data-state="active" id="radix-:R19:-trigger-map" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md py-1 font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 data-[state=active]:bg-background data-[state=active]:text-foreground data-[state=active]:shadow px-3 text-[11px] transition-none" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" data-radix-collection-item="">假设图</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="radix-:R19:-content-matrix" data-state="inactive" id="radix-:R19:-trigger-matrix" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md py-1 font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 data-[state=active]:bg-background data-[state=active]:text-foreground data-[state=active]:shadow px-3 text-[11px] transition-none" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" data-radix-collection-item="">证据矩阵</button></div></div><p class="px-[18px] py-3 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">派生关系未记录</p><div data-state="active" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:R19:-trigger-map" id="radix-:R19:-content-map" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 research-evidence m-0" style="animation-duration:0s"><div class="research-hypothesis-grid" role="group" aria-label="假设派生图"><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H1</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">◐ 收窄</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">ca_rebound 的额外电流是净内向、超极化…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">ca_rebound 的额外电流是净内向、超极化恢复可用性的瞬态电流（T型钙样或 Ih 样）：超极化条件刺激解除失活/激活该电流，释放后在去极化测试期产生额外内向驱动，使测试期峰数显著高于裸细胞基线（15.3±噪声）。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H2</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">◐ 收窄</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">ca_rebound 的额外电流是活动依赖的外向…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">ca_rebound 的额外电流是活动依赖的外向 K 流（适应型）：去极化条件刺激激活它，压制后续测试反应；超极化条件刺激后测试反应不高于基线。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H3</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">✓ 得到支持</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">额外电流对常规步进与超极化释放协议无显著影响（效…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">额外电流对常规步进与超极化释放协议无显著影响（效应集中在基线通道的慢 Na 失活动力学，slow_na=true），即放电表观变化全部可由基线通道解释，无需额外反弹电流。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H4</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">◐ 收窄</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">H1 的 SCOPED 变体：ca_reboun…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">H1 的 SCOPED 变体：ca_rebound 存在小电导（g≈0.05-0.15）的弱内向电流（Ih 样或弱 T 型样），超极化恢复其可用性，释放后提供适度内向驱动——足以解释 P1 观测 17.33 相对基线 15.33 的 +2.0 弱增强，但不足以达到 H1 的强反弹带 [18,30]。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H5</span><span class="text-destructive">✕ 被否定</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">H4 的快瞬态 flavour：弱内向电流是 T…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">H4 的快瞬态 flavour：弱内向电流是 T 型钙样瞬态流（快 m 激活 + 快 h 失活恢复，h_tau≈40ms），40ms 超极化即充分恢复可用性，释放时产生瞬态爆发驱动——预测 brief hyperpol 40ms 协议显著增强（+4 以上），而慢 Ih 样 flavour 在该协议无效应。</span></button></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:R19:-trigger-matrix" hidden="" id="radix-:R19:-content-matrix" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 research-evidence m-0"></div></div><div class="border-t border-border/60 p-[18px]"><p class="mb-3 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">实验记录 · 按登记顺序 · 点击查看预测、测量与判读</p><div class="research-path"><button type="button" title="P1（3 次）"><span class="font-mono">P1</span><span class="max-w-40 truncate text-muted-foreground">（3 次）</span></button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><button type="button" title="P2（1 次）"><span class="font-mono">P2</span><span class="max-w-40 truncate text-muted-foreground">（1 次）</span></button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><button type="button" title="P3（1 次）"><span class="font-mono">P3</span><span class="max-w-40 truncate text-muted-foreground">（1 次）</span></button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><button type="button" title="P4（1 次）"><span class="font-mono">P4</span><span class="max-w-40 truncate text-muted-foreground">（1 次）</span></button></div></div></section><section class="research-panel"><h3 class="research-panel-heading">一次反馈改变</h3><div class="research-panel-body"><ul class="space-y-0.5 text-[13px]"><li>P1 → P2</li><li>原协议：hyperpol conditioning + depol test (-30 uA/250 ms, then +12 uA)；实测 17.33（3 次），落在 H3 的预测区间</li><li>因此：H1 → ◐ 收窄、H2 → ? 有争议</li><li>新协议：brief hyperpol conditioning + test (-30 uA/40 ms, then +12 uA)；目的：brief hyperpol 40ms 协议下真细胞 spike_count（reps=1）：ref/slow_na 校准 13.0、weakIh 校准 17.0、weakT 校准 20.0——三分 H3（无额外效应）/ H4（弱内向，慢 Ih flavour）/ H5（弱内向，快 T flavour）。</li></ul></div></section><div class="research-bottom-grid"><section class="research-panel"><h3 class="research-panel-heading">阶段报告</h3><div class="research-panel-body"><div class="research-stage-section"><h4 class="text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground">已知</h4><ul><li>H3 SUPPORTED</li><li>H4 SCOPED</li><li>H5 REFUTED</li></ul></div><div class="research-stage-section"><h4 class="text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground">未知</h4><ul><li>暂无记录</li></ul></div><div class="research-stage-section"><h4 class="text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground">下一步</h4><ul><li>已结束</li></ul></div></div></section></div><section class="research-panel"><h3 class="research-panel-heading">画布标记（只打标，宿主不强制）</h3><div class="research-panel-body"><ul class="space-y-0.5 text-[12px] text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400"><li>M-reps · 第 67 行 · 依据 P2 只测了 1 次</li><li>M-single · 第 67 行 · 否定只依据 P2 一个探针</li><li>M-reps · 第 68 行 · 依据 P2 只测了 1 次</li><li>M-null · 第 104 行 · REPORT.md:11 把&quot;没测到&quot;写成&quot;不存在&quot;</li><li>M-null · 第 104 行 · REPORT.md:17 把&quot;没测到&quot;写成&quot;不存在&quot;</li><li>M-null · 第 104 行 · REPORT.md:21 把&quot;没测到&quot;写成&quot;不存在&quot;</li></ul></div></section></div></div></div>"`;
